<li><span class="kind">Concept</span> <a href="/e/acme-infra/access-model?s=platform">Access model</a> <span class="summary">Who may do what in Acme&#39;s cloud accounts, and how admin rights are granted for a limited time.</span></li>
<li><span class="kind">Concept</span> <a href="/e/acme-infra/argocd?s=platform">Argo CD</a> <span class="summary">Rolls every Helm release in this repo out to its cluster, and shows what is deployed where.</span></li>
<li><span class="kind">Guide</span> <a href="/e/acme-infra/request-access?s=platform">Request access rights</a> <span class="summary">Get time-limited admin rights for a cloud account, with a reason.</span></li>
</ul>
